# Architecture

Full detail: `docs/architecture/SYSTEM-ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/architecture/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`.

## Stack (approved)

- Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript **strict**
- Server Components by default; Client Components only for interactivity
- Zod for input validation
- Firebase Auth (Google), Cloud Firestore, GCS, Cloud Run
- Secret Manager, Cloud Logging, Cloud Scheduler
- Google Drive / Docs / Sheets APIs for **import prep only**

Do not add a library for one trivial function. Call `pick-ui-library` before UI deps.

## Layers

```text
UI → Application services → Domain → Repositories → Infrastructure adapters → External APIs
```

Also separate: authorization, audit, search.

## Source of truth

- Published content truth = **portal database**.
- Google Docs/Sheets/Drive = external import sources only.
- External sources must not mutate published content directly.
- Publish flow: detect → fetch → normalize → preview version → diff → admin confirm → new version → publish → reindex → audit.

## Automation boundary

**Automatic:** detect changes, fetch, draft preview, compute diffs, log errors, notify admin, reindex after publish.

**Manual only:** accept external changes, resolve conflicts, publish, delete, restore versions.

## Search (v1)

No separate search infra until real data volume justifies it. On publish, write a normalized search document into a versioned JSON index (e.g. GCS). Index must exclude drafts. Semantic/RAG only after confirmed need.

## Structure

Follow `src/app/(public|admin|api)`, `components/`, `features/`, `domain/`, `server/{auth,repositories,services,integrations,security,audit}`, `lib/`, `config/`, `styles/`, `tests/`.
